<title>MALAYSIA: GOLF-MALAYSIAN OPEN GOLF SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-MALAYSIAN OPEN GOLF SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first round scores</p>
<p>in the Malaysian Open golf championship on Thursday:</p>
<p>64 Lee Westwood (Britain)</p>
<p>66 Larry Barber (U.S.), Craig McClellan (U.S.)</p>
<p>68 Mardan Mamat (Singapore), Carlos Larrain (Venezuela)</p>
<p>69 Mike Cunning (U.S), Stewart Ginn (Australia), David</p>
<p>Howell (Britain), Paul McGinley (Ireland).</p>
</text>
